[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m============================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36mScene 2: Indirect injection taints an interactive session\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mDataBot may write reports. Then it reads a web page with a hidden instruction. The page is untrusted, so the session is tainted and writing is removed until it ends.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "       \u001b[2moperator minted an agent token: sub=anna@demo agent=databot mode=interactive session=s-j7A0PH6UG8mWBXu7\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.138, "o", "\u001b[1manna (analyst) via DataBot\u001b[0m  reports.write_report(name='demo-005737-q3.md', content='Q3: 40')\r\n"]
