[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36mScene 3: Autonomous agent: held for approval, not stopped\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mThe same page reaches nightly_etl, which has no human to ask. Its write is not removed: it waits for an approver, and the risky process is throttled meanwhile.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
