[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36mScene 4: A query too expensive to run\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mThe agent writes a triple cross join. sql_guard asks the planner for its cost (EXPLAIN, never ANALYZE) and refuses it before Postgres does any work.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "       \u001b[2moperator minted an agent token: sub=anna@demo agent=databot mode=interactive session=s-2rrfPDOfJxJpC6R1\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.123, "o", "\u001b[1manna (analyst) via DataBot\u001b[0m  sales_db.query(sql='SELECT COUNT(*) AS count FROM sales.customers CROSS JOIN sales.orders CROSS JOIN sales.payments')\r\n"]
[0.601, "o", "    \u001b[33m->\u001b[0m REFUSED reason_code=sql_cost_exceeded\r\n"]
[0.140, "o", "       \u001b[2maudit: read db:sales.payments -> block (sql_cost_exceeded)  risk=0.00  taint=false  rev=f83f261412c7  verdicts: sql_guard/pre=sql_cost_exceeded\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[32m[PASS] heavy cross join: sql_cost_exceeded\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.194, "o", "\u001b[1moperator\u001b[0m  EXPLAIN (FORMAT JSON) as anna@demo, the statement sql_guard priced\r\n    \u001b[32m->\u001b[0m planner Total Cost 70,495.2 > max_cost 10,000\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[32m[PASS] planner cost above max_cost: True\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[32mScene 4 as expected in 1.1 s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m============================================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36mScene 5: PII redacted before the model, secrets never sent\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mA prompt with a PESEL reaches the model with the number masked, so the model cannot repeat or use it. A prompt with an API key is refused before any model call.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n"]
